{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295160","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1029516001:2":{"text":"萨基塔里斯大人！很高兴见到您！但是您出现的话……","source_cn":"萨基塔里斯大人！很高兴见到您！但是您出现的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62B9EE3F39515AF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029516002:1":{"text":"嗯？我以为见到我你们会更惊喜一些。","source_cn":"嗯？我以为见到我你们会更惊喜一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CB6332ADD0EA33D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029516003:1":{"text":"是很惊喜……但是您出现的话，应该不是来给送月神的宝藏吧……","source_cn":"是很惊喜……但是您出现的话，应该不是来给送月神的宝藏吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA37065B7EB3D703F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029516004:1":{"text":"月神的宝藏？我这里确实没有。","source_cn":"月神的宝藏？我这里确实没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDD474727881205B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029516005:1":{"text":"看来你们又经历了一段不错的旅程，但是对结果似乎不够满意？","source_cn":"看来你们又经历了一段不错的旅程，但是对结果似乎不够满意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9279A2D8207F14E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_